                "textId": "Performance_1999990017_1917485789_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A拒绝}不……这不可能！讨厌规则！\n涂掉它就是为了嘲笑它！\n我竟然……成了定规则的人？！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990017_1917485789_content",
                "value": "{A拒绝}不……这不可能！讨厌规则！\n涂掉它就是为了嘲笑它！\n我竟然……成了定规则的人？！",
